        title: 'Branded Interfaces & National SAML 2.0 Integration',
        text: 'Designed and deployed branded login/signup/account interfaces across all environments while maintaining consistent client branding standards. Successfully engineered SAML 2.0 integrations with internal Azure SSO and external Singapore national identity providers (Singpass & Corppass), ensuring seamless authentication workflows.'
